{"id":33630864827,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAH1I5Fuw","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-21992-analytics-per-table-type-timestamps","head_sha":"5f6369d235eabbf5711db974078c5f6a90eb7ffc","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":52389,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"feat: add per-table-type analytics update timestamps [DHIS2-21992]","status":"completed","conclusion":"cancelled","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":91133717681,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAVN_4ssQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827","created_at":"2026-09-02T12:36:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T12:42:36Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-02T12:36:25Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/91133717681","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/33630864827/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"refactor: use EnumMap loop instead of Collectors.toMap in getLastSuccessfulUpdateByType\n\nAddresses Luciano's review comment on #24899: drops the Arrays/LinkedHashMap/\nCollectors.toMap combination for a plain loop into an EnumMap, which is the\nnatural map type for an enum key. Also verified this removes a latent\nfootgun: Collectors.toMap's merge-function overload delegates to Map.merge,\nwhich throws NullPointerException for a null value - the EnumMap loop has no\nsuch restriction. Confirmed via jshell that this isn't currently reachable\n(both getters passed in fall back to a @Nonnull epoch Date rather than\nreturning null), but the utility method's own signature doesn't guarantee\nthat for future callers, so it's a real robustness improvement, not just\nfewer imports.\n\nIteration order is unchanged: EnumMap always iterates in enum declaration\norder, and AnalyticsTableType.values() already returns elements in that\nsame order, so filtering doesn't change the resulting order compared to the\nprevious LinkedHashMap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"5f6369d235eabbf5711db974078c5f6a90eb7ffc","tree_id":"95b087b1a0e514404cc7cf6cc5acb4cae61ff8b9","timestamp":"2026-09-02T12:36:13Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fo